<title>SPAIN: DSL tops up Matador by 10 bln ptas - Argentaria.</title>
<headline>DSL tops up Matador by 10 bln ptas - Argentaria.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Siedlungs- und Landesrentenbank (DSL) is topping up by 10 billion pesetas at a price of 103.635 its 8.5 percent Matador launched in February 1996, bookrunner Argentaria, which is lead managing the issue with UBS and J.P. Morgan, said.</p>
<p>Total fees are 1.875 percent. The pay date is October 4. The issue will expire February 28, 2006.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
